fi
text With my final insurance, the conversation thankfully somehow comes to an end.
text It doesn't take long before Fuko returns to her work.
text We all spend the whole day together. I hope that serves as a reminder to Fuko that she's not alone.
text I would be satisfied if that's enough to keep her focused on her carving without any worry.
music ~
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
